    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="For N_2O_4 \rightleftharpoons 2NO_2, this plots the total Gibbs energy of the reacting mixture as a function of the extent of reaction \xi and shows that solve_equilibrium_composition&#x27;s answer sits exactly at the minimum -- the numerical method actually doing what its name says. It also shows a van&#x27;t Hoff plot (~chemistrykit.thermo.systems.equilibrium.fit_van_t_hoff) recovering a reaction&#x27;s enthalpy from synthetic equilibrium-constant-vs- temperature data.">

